396e4369" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097737 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186097738 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097737 #edb/ref 1061 430121 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097737 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "961ff0d0-9cef-5a2d-8207-63481c0cc1ab" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097737 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186097833 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097738 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186097739 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097738 #edb/ref 1061 430122 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097738 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e301e3f9-501f-5f63-afac-f53379b62c13" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097738 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186096813 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097739 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186097740 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097739 #edb/ref 1061 430125 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097739 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "957d3735-2041-5bec-9e7c-4c1623dd4899" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097739 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186096814 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097740 #edb/ref 1061 430128 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097740 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "11ad8934-d3f9-546c-b161-9058d251ac66" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097740 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186096815 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097833 #edb/ref 1064 "A **unit vector** is a vector whose magnitude is equal to $1$.\n\nGiven any vector $\\mathbf a$, we can create a unit vector $\\mathbf u$ by dividing $\\mathbf a$ by its magnitude $\\mid \\, \\mathbf{a} \\, \\mid$, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{u} = \\dfrac{\\mathbf{a}}{\\mid \\,\\mathbf{a}\\, \\mid}\n$$\n\nFor example, if\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mid \\,\\mathbf{a}\\, &= 2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nthen the unit vector is\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{u} = \\dfrac{\\mathbf{a}}{2} = \\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathbf{a}\n$$\n\n![](images/c7/c78d5b75c1d5928e7b269a4a67229487b3d3324e9815b11c5fd1f47f63437d82.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097833 #edb/ref 1065 2906 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097833 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "a90fd4b3-d41f-589f-9067-39d57e3e8712" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186097833 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186502222 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186502217 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502222 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502222 #edb/ref 1071 "The vector $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ has magnitude $30$. Which of the following is a unit vector that is parallel to $\\overrightarrow{AB}$?" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502222 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "0addcaab-466a-56b5-8876-89572e8523d0" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502222 #edb/ref 1074 "To obtain the unit vector that is parallel to $\\overrightarrow{AB}$, we divide $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ by its length:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{u}=\\dfrac{\\overrightarrow{AB}}{\\mid \\,\\overrightarrow{AB}\\, \\mid}=\\dfrac{1}{30}\\overrightarrow{AB}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502223 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186502257 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502223 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502223 #edb/ref 1071 "The vector $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ has magnitude $\\frac{13}{8}$. Which of the following is a unit vector that is parallel to $\\overrightarrow{AB}$?" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502223 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "0dfdf152-882f-5405-a75a-91f741a85b30" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502223 #edb/ref 1074 "To obtain the unit vector that is parallel to $\\overrightarrow{AB}$, we divide $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ by its length:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{u}=\\dfrac{\\overrightarrow{AB}}{\\mid \\,\\overrightarrow{AB}\\, \\mid}=\\dfrac{1}{\\frac{13}{8}}\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\frac{8}{13}\\overrightarrow{AB}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502225 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186502307 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502225 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502225 #edb/ref 1071 "The vector $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ has magnitude $\\frac{17}{8}$. Which of the following is a unit vector that is parallel to $\\overrightarrow{AB}$?" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502225 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "102d558d-5f91-58de-9348-d0fc95d217f6" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502225 #edb/ref 1074 "To obtain the unit vector that is parallel to $\\overrightarrow{AB}$, we divide $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ by its length:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{u}=\\dfrac{\\overrightarrow{AB}}{\\mid \\,\\overrightarrow{AB}\\, \\mid}=\\dfrac{1}{\\frac{17}{8}}\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\frac{8}{17}\\overrightarrow{AB}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502232 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186502321 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502232 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502232 #edb/ref 1071 "The vector $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ has magnitude $11$. Which of the following is a unit vector that is parallel to $\\overrightarrow{AB}$?" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502232 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "25392aed-7aa6-5736-bb26-a65857eaae39" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502232 #edb/ref 1074 "To obtain the unit vector that is parallel to $\\overrightarrow{AB}$, we divide $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ by its length:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{u}=\\dfrac{\\overrightarrow{AB}}{\\mid \\,\\overrightarrow{AB}\\, \\mid}=\\dfrac{1}{11}\\overrightarrow{AB}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502236 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186502320 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502236 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502236 #edb/ref 1071 "The vector $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ has magnitude $2 \\sqrt{13}$. Which of the following is a unit vector that is parallel to $\\overrightarrow{AB}$?" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502236 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "308cd260-de2f-5867-9807-fbf62077a6f4" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186502236 #edb/ref 1074 "To obtain the unit vector that is parallel to $\\overrightarrow{AB}$, we divide $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ by its length:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{u}=\\dfrac{\\overrightarrow{AB}}{\\mid \\,\\overrightarrow{AB}\\, \\mid}=\\dfrac{1}{2 \\sqrt{13}}\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\frac{